{{TOCright}}
This is a '''list of quotes by {{ai|Gekko}}'''. Gekko is voiced by 
Alejandro Antonio Ruiz in English, with his other creatures: [[Mosh Pit|Mosh]] voiced by Paul Guyet, [[Wingman]] voiced by Kellen Goff, and both [[Dizzy]] and [[Thrash]] voiced by Jan Johns. Necessary quotes translated are from Spanish to English. Gekko himself has a total of {{#expr:{{PAGESINCATEGORY:Gekko Quotes}} - {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Gekko Creature Quotes}}}} files of quotes, and his creatures have a total of {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Gekko Creature Quotes}} files of quotes, giving Gekko and his creatures a grand total of {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Gekko Quotes}} files of quotes including unused and removed lines, and excluding [[#The Range's lore assets|The Range's lore assets]]. Each of the creatures has a distinct voice, and using that alongside context clues (like a gendered pronoun) allows for the assumption of which one is "speaking".

A downloadable folder containing all the audio files on this page can be found [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1n974CSviKimMeLvCBMGT7WVO48dFs0n9?usp=sharing here].

