==[[Range/Lore|The Range's lore assets]]==
===[[Range/Lore/EP6|Episode 6]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone49.mp3}} "Ayo [[Brimstone|Brimmy Brim]]! Hear me out! I love the room for real but, like, my crew needs their own space sometimes and it's a little crowded right now so, check this: what if we knock down some of the walls, combine my room with the one next door, double it up! Eh? Eh?? Let me know what you think!"
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone52.mp3}} "Hey Sarge, qué onda? Look, I uh, I know there's some concern about my crew dipping into our [[radianite]] reserves, especially with what's going on, but, listen - they eat what they eat. [[Killjoy|KJ]] and I are watching their intake, there's no change in their behavior and nothing different. I- I get that people are jumpy, but to be honest, like, no one really knows anything about my critters, they're just guessing, and I really think it's fine. So, could you run some interference, give the official okay. I don't know? Something? Would go a long way. Thanks."

===[[Range/Lore/EP7|Episode 7]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone58.mp3}} "Brimstone. I've overheard some stuff and I wanna clear some things up with you. My crew are not monsters. They will never be monsters, period. If anything were to happen, which it won't, that's on me. I'll take that responsibility. But until then, tell [[Deadlock]] she's gotta chill. Her cold stares are killing our vibe. Appreciate it."

===[[Range/Lore/EP9|Episode 9]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone94.mp3}} "Brimstone, I am sorry to call you but someone... [[Wingman]]... snuck into your office and took a music record without asking. He knows it was wrong and would like to apologize. Ven aquí, apologize!... Apologize!... He says he's sorry. Alright, get out of here. Yeah real sorry about that Brim, won't happen again. I checked the record, no scratches, it's on your desk."
**(''Ven aquí'': Come here)

===[[Range/Lore/V25|Season 2025]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone108.mp3}} "Yo, jefe. I've been talking to [[Harbor|Coach]] and I wanted to check with you. I've been training for a hot minute so I feel like it's time for me to start learning some new new shit, ya know? Like... the VLT/R? Like... flying the VLT/R, alright? C-Cause think about how useful it would be to have another pilot on the team, ya know? Someone else... like me! Just saying! That's all I got, think about it!"

